---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-media">
    <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/14599070/pexels-photo-14599070.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1600" alt="Man lifting weights in a gym">
  </div>
  <div class="hero-copy wrap">
    <div class="hero-tag"><span class="dot"></span><span class="mono">STARTED THIS BLOG: 2026</span></div>
    <h1>No certification.<br>Just <em>obsessed</em>.</h1>
    <p>I'm not a trainer or a coach — just a guy who fell hard for fitness and started writing down what I'm learning. Wins, plateaus, bad form corrections, all of it.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="#posts">Read the Blog</a>
      <a class="btn-outline" href="#about">Why "Unqualified"?</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set allPosts = collections.posts | reverse %}
{% set latest = allPosts | first %}

<section class="featured-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Latest Post</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">The most recent thing I've figured out — or gotten wrong.</p>
    </div>
    {% if latest %}
    <a href="{{ latest.url }}" style="display:block;">
      <article class="featured-card">
        <div class="featured-media">
          <img src="{{ latest.data.image }}" alt="{{ latest.data.title }}">
        </div>
        <div class="featured-body">
          <span class="tag-pill tag-{{ latest.data.category | lower }}">{{ latest.data.category }}</span>
          <h3>{{ latest.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ latest.data.excerpt }}</p>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span>{{ latest.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
            <span>&middot;</span>
            <span>{{ latest.data.readtime }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="grid-section" id="posts">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>All Posts</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Everything I've written so far — good weeks and rough ones.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in allPosts %}
      {% if not loop.first %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">
          <div class="post-thumb">
            <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">
          </div>
          <span class="tag-pill tag-{{ post.data.category | lower }}">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
          <div class="post-meta">
            <span>{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
            <span>&middot;</span>
            <span>{{ post.data.readtime }}</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about-photo">
      <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/4164759/pexels-photo-4164759.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700" alt="Person working out at the gym">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="about-tag">Why this exists</div>
      <h2>I'm not qualified to coach you. I just love this too much to stay quiet about it.</h2>
      <div class="about-list">
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="num mono">01</span>
          <p>No certifications, no credentials — I'm learning in public, not teaching from a stage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="num mono">02</span>
          <p>The fails get posted too. Plateaus, skipped weeks, bad form — all of it, not just the wins.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="num mono">03</span>
          <p>What started as a gym log on my phone turned into this. It's still just that, dressed up a little.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="subscribe" id="subscribe">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Follow along in real time.</h2>
    <p>Join the WhatsApp channel — new posts, quick updates, no spam.</p>
    <a class="btn-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/254718300059" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join on WhatsApp</a>
    <div class="sub-note">FREE TO JOIN. LEAVE ANYTIME.</div>
  </div>
</section>
